    "id": "auth_bearer_off",
    "level": "behavior",
    "keys": [
     "auth.allow_bearer"
    ],
    "text": {
     "en": "Sessions of scripts and apps (the Authorization: Bearer header) are no longer accepted unless auth.allow_bearer is on.",
     "es": "Las sesiones de scripts y apps (la cabecera Authorization: Bearer) ya no se aceptan salvo que auth.allow_bearer esté activo.",
     "de": "Sitzungen von Skripten und Apps (der Header Authorization: Bearer) werden nur noch akzeptiert, wenn auth.allow_bearer eingeschaltet ist.",
     "fr": "Les sessions de scripts et d'applications (l'en-tête Authorization: Bearer) ne sont plus acceptées sauf si auth.allow_bearer est activé.",
     "it": "Le sessioni di script e app (l'intestazione Authorization: Bearer) non sono più accettate se auth.allow_bearer non è attivo.",
     "ja": "スクリプトやアプリのセッション（Authorization: Bearer ヘッダー）は、auth.allow_bearer をオンにしない限り受け付けられなくなりました。",
     "zh": "除非开启 auth.allow_bearer，否则不再接受脚本和应用的会话（Authorization: Bearer 头）。",
     "pt": "As sessões de scripts e aplicações (o cabeçalho Authorization: Bearer) já não são aceites, a menos que auth.allow_bearer esteja ativo."
    },
    "old_value": true,
    "new_value": false
   }
  ]
